ipal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is), because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not ","type":"text"},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 26+), which would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"top toolbar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" can have an optional label vocalized by Voice Over for a particular case. Indeed, if there is no large title, and no element in principal item,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the title and the subtitle can be hidden from Voice Over and the given accessibility label can be vocalized instead."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is better to bring meaningfull texts in your navigation instead of tricking the UI with Voice Over dedicated values."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscategoricaltag\/toolbartop(_:haslargetitle:subtitle:accessibilitylabel:leadingitems:principalitem:trailingitems:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSCategoricalTag":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCategoricalTag"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCategoricalTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a non-interactive label used to visually distinguish non-functional categories using categorical colours.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can represent information such as promotions, events, benefits or other locally defined categories.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It does not communicate functional status or system feedback.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for success, warning, error, availability or other functional states.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCategoricalTag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tag only when its colour categories are defined by the product or local market guidelines.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscategoricaltag","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCategoricalTag"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCategoricalTag","title":"OUDSCategoricalTag","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Components","kind":"text"}],"title":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSToolBarItem":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbaritem","type":"